            "title": "设置代理解决GitHub连接问题",
            "date_published": "2025-03-08T10:30:10.000Z",
            "content_html": "<h2 id=\"设置-ssh-代理\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#设置-ssh-代理\">#</a> 设置 ssh 代理</h2>\n<div class=\"note primary\">\n<p>在设置之前，请确保正确配置了  <code>ssh</code>  免密钥登录</p>\n</div>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>在 config 文件中添加以下行</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight yaml\"><figcaption data-lang=\"YAML\"><span>命令 参考链接</span><span class=\"exturl\" data-url=\"aHR0cHM6Ly96aHVhbmxhbi56aGlodS5jb20vcC80ODE1NzQwMjQ=\">link</span></figcaption><table><tr class=\"marked\"><td data-num=\"1\"></td><td><pre>ProxyCommand \"C<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\\APP\\Git\\mingw64\\bin\\connect\" <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>S 127.0.0.1<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>51837 <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>a none %h %p</pre></td></tr></table></figure><div class=\"note info\">\n<p>你应该替换你自己本地代理的端口号以及 <code>connect</code>  的路径</p>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>测试</p>\n<p>在你配置完并打开本地代理后在终端输入</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight powershell\"><figcaption data-lang=\"PowerShell\"><span>命令</span><a href=\"https://yunyat.cloud\">参考链接</a></figcaption><table><tr class=\"marked\"><td data-num=\"1\"></td><td><pre>ssh <span class=\"token operator\">-</span>T git@github<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>com</pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>出现图中所示结果则表示成功</p>\n<p><img data-src=\"https://figurebed.yunyat.cloud/imgs/image-20250308185046181.png\" alt=\"image-20250308185046181\"></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<p><em>END</em></p>\n",
            "tags": [
                "SSH",
                "GitHub"
            ]
        }
    ]
